      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300750073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Excuse-moi, jeune <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЄhommfille.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500780063007500730065002D006D006F0069002C0020006A00650075006E0065002000100003110000FF04040068006F006D006D00660069006C006C0065002E00100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Est-ce que je peux te poser quelques questions ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074002D0063006500200071007500650020006A00650020007000650075007800200074006500200070006F0073006500720020007100750065006C00710075006500730020007100750065007300740069006F006E00730020003F00100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Est-ce que c’est ton Pokémon ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074002D00630065002000710075006500200063201900650073007400200074006F006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est la première fois que je le vois.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006C00610020007000720065006D006900E80072006500200066006F0069007300200071007500650020006A00650020006C006500200076006F00690073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Devant moi, j’ai un banc couvert de bave, un\nMucuscule, et toi juste à côté.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aimerais savoir ce qu’il s’est passé, et faire en\nsorte que ça ne se reproduise pas. Je ne vois<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npersonne d’autre à qui demander, donc...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Est-ce que tu saurais à qui le Mucuscule\nappartient, s’il n’est pas à toi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aucune idée.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007500630075006E006500200069006400E90065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À... quelqu’un d’autre ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C0002E002E002E0020007100750065006C0071007520190075006E002000642019006100750074007200650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sans commentaire.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006E007300200063006F006D006D0065006E00740061006900720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vois...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200076006F00690073002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hum.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480075006D002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais qu’est-ce que tu fais près de ce banc,\nsi ce n’est pas ton Mucuscule ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je voulais le caresser.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200076006F0075006C0061006900730020006C0065002000630061007200650073007300650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je voulais m’asseoir.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200076006F0075006C0061006900730020006D20190061007300730065006F00690072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sans commentaire.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006E007300200063006F006D006D0065006E00740061006900720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah d’accord... Pas de problème !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002000642019006100630063006F00720064002E002E002E0020005000610073002000640065002000700072006F0062006C00E8006D006500200021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hum.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480075006D002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Au fait, tu es du quartier ? Tu connais peut-être\nquelqu’un qui saurait à qui il appartient.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne suis pas d’ici.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E0065002000730075006900730020007000610073002000642019006900630069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sans commentaire.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006E007300200063006F006D006D0065006E00740061006900720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, vraiment... ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C00200076007200610069006D0065006E0074002E002E002E0020003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hum.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480075006D002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, pour vérifier : tu confirmes que ce n’est pas\nton Mucuscule ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E002C00200070006F007500720020007600E90072006900660069006500720020003A00200074007500200063006F006E006600690072006D0065007300200071007500650020006300650020006E20190065007300740020007000610073000A0074006F006E0020004D007500630075007300630075006C00650020003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je confirme.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200063006F006E006600690072006D0065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai jamais vu ce Mucuscule.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E2019006100690020006A0061006D0061006900730020007600750020006300650020004D007500630075007300630075006C0065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu sais, ça ne serait pas grave, si c’était le tien.\nOn doit juste trouver son propriétaire.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuscule !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430075007300630075006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est drôle à quel point il a l’air de bien t’aimer,\nalors qu’il ne t’appartient pas...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, si ce n’est pas le tien, tu peux me montrer\nles Pokémon que tu as avec toi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En d’autres termes... fais un combat contre moi !\nMontre-moi ton équipe en situation !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh bien, au moins, je n’ai plus le moindre doute\nsur tes capacités en combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu sais te défendre, c’est sûr.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000730061006900730020007400650020006400E900660065006E006400720065002C0020006320190065007300740020007300FB0072002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mucuscule ! Je t’ai dit de ne pas t’éloigner !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007500630075007300630075006C0065002000210020004A00650020007420190061006900200064006900740020006400650020006E0065002000700061007300200074201900E9006C006F00690067006E006500720020002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mucus !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et maintenant, le banc est tout poisseux...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500740020006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002C0020006C0065002000620061006E0063002000650073007400200074006F0075007400200070006F006900730073006500750078002E002E002E00100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et voilà, c’est nettoyé ! Allez, rentrons\nà la maison, Mucuscule !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200076006F0069006C00E0002C0020006320190065007300740020006E006500740074006F007900E90020002100200041006C006C0065007A002C002000720065006E00740072006F006E0073000A00E00020006C00610020006D006100690073006F006E002C0020004D007500630075007300630075006C00650020002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ! Tu disais la vérité, ce n’était donc pas\nton Mucuscule !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680020002100200054007500200064006900730061006900730020006C00610020007600E900720069007400E9002C0020006300650020006E201900E9007400610069007400200064006F006E00630020007000610073000A0074006F006E0020004D007500630075007300630075006C006500200021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Désolée de t’avoir soupçonné<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe. Il y a tellement\nde Pokémon sauvages à Illumis, ces temps-ci...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe ne sais plus où donner de la tête.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour te remercier d’avoir discuté avec moi,\nj’ai une petite info pour toi !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPour faire évoluer un Mucuscule jusqu’à son\névolution finale, il faut qu’il pleuve.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 167
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sur ce, je retourne à mes affaires. Porte-toi bien !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750072002000630065002C0020006A00650020007200650074006F00750072006E0065002000E00020006D00650073002000610066006600610069007200650073002E00200050006F007200740065002D0074006F00690020006200690065006E00200021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    }
